finding('FCR-008','Dispatch denominator and intake binding disagree with artifacts','NON_BLOCKING_OBSERVATION','LOW',['user dispatch: read artifacts and record disagreements','verify/harness/LAUNCHER_TEST_RESULTS.txt:final RESULT','verify/ao12/INTAKE_AT_DISPATCH.json:candidate,freeze_method'],['INTAKE_AT_DISPATCH.json','run_harness_negative_tests.sh.result.json'], 'Dispatch says launcher 39/0 and empty candidate digests; frozen launcher artifact says 38/0 and original intake contains AO11 commit/digests/temp. Independent current replay returns 39/0. The new NT6 containment assertion explains the replay count, but the frozen result has not been refreshed.','Distinguish dispatch prose, historical intake, frozen raw results and independently recomputed current results; never silently select the favorable value.','Bounded provenance/count discrepancy; independently rebound intake prevents wrong-subject review.','Dispatch / evidence packaging','Refresh dispatch metadata and result artifacts in a separate maker change; retain originals. No candidate repair performed.',repro='EVIDENCE_ONLY')
